ty and known-price revenue are calculated by application/database code. Unknown-price sales remain visible and flagged; totals label incomplete revenue. |","source":"description"},"occurrences":null,"type":"Requirement","community":10,"community_name":"Analytics and missing data"},"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-09":{"id":"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-09","description":{"status":"generated","description":"| FR-09 | Must | Create line, bar, and KPI widgets from validated metric/dimension/filter choices; neither raw SQL nor executable chart code is accepted from the model. |","source":"description"},"occurrences":null,"type":"Requirement","community":1,"community_name":"Manual access and accessibility"},"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-10":{"id":"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-10","description":{"status":"generated","description":"| FR-10 | Must | Date/product filters and explicit prior-period comparison affect queries; missing dates are gaps, while explicitly confirmed zero-sales dates are zero. |","source":"description"},"occurrences":null,"type":"Requirement","community":10,"community_name":"Analytics and missing data"},"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-11":{"id":"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-11","description":{"status":"generated","description":"| FR-11 | Must | Tapping a chart datum opens authorized source transactions using exactly the same query predicates and revision. |","source":"description"},"occurrences":null,"type":"Requirement","community":10,"community_name":"Analytics and missing data"},"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-12":{"id":"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-12","description":{"status":"generated","description":"| FR-12 | Must | Voice and manual actions add, edit, move, resize and remove widgets; an ambiguous “that chart” asks for a target. Ledger records never change from layout actions. |","source":"description"},"occurrences":null,"type":"Requirement","community":1,"community_name":"Manual access and accessibility"},"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-13":{"id":"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-13","description":{"status":"generated","description":"| FR-13 | Must | Named dashboards persist versioned configuration and responsive layout; reopening recomputes current data and shows its revision and refresh time. |","source":"description"},"occurrences":null,"type":"Requirement","community":1,"community_name":"Manual access and accessibility"},"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-14":{"id":"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-14","description":{"status":"generated","description":"| FR-14 | Must | Every ledger mutation uses server-enforced idempotency; concurrent/retried identical requests yield one logical commit and the same receipt. Reuse with different arguments is rejected. |","source":"description"},"occurrences":null,"type":"Requirement","community":9,"community_name":"Atomic sales and retries"},"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-15":{"id":"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-15","description":{"status":"generated","description":"| FR-15 | Must | Confirmed mutations return a receipt, updated revision, affected IDs and undo availability. Failed tools never produce success confirmations. |","source":"description"},"occurrences":null,"type":"Requirement","community":9,"community_name":"Atomic sales and retries"},"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-16":{"id":"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-16","description":{"status":"generated","description":"| FR-16 | Must | Synthetic fixtures display a demo label, are isolated from real records, and can be reset only in the owner's demo workspace. |","source":"description"},"occurrences":null,"type":"Requirement","community":12,"community_name":"Verification and release readiness"},"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-17":{"id":"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-17","description":{"status":"generated","description":"| FR-17 | Should | Cancel a pending proposal or disconnect safely without losing an acknowledged commit; reconnect refreshes authoritative state before another change. |","source":"description"},"occurrences":null,"type":"Requirement","community":6,"community_name":"Corrections and undo"},"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-18":{"id":"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-18","description":{"status":"generated","description":"| FR-18 | Must | Owner can create, rename and deactivate catalog products and set an optional default price through manual controls. Deactivation preserves historical sales; changing a default price never changes recorded prices. |","source":"description"},"occurrences":null,"type":"Requirement","community":6,"community_name":"Corrections and undo"},"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-19":{"id":"docs/02-SRS.md#FR-19","description":{"status":"generated","description":"| FR-19 | Must | Owner explicitly confirms or reopens a business day's completeness. Show its date and consequences before applying; the action is authorized, idempotent and audited. |","source":"description"},"occurrences":null,"type":"Requirement","community":7,"community_name":"Verification and release readiness"},"docs/02-SRS.md#section-36":{"id":"docs/02-SRS.md#section-36","description":{"status":"generated","description":"## Nonfunctional requirements","source":"description"},"occurrences":null,"type":"Section","community":1,"community_name":"Manual access and accessibility"},"docs/02-SRS.md#NFR-01":{"id":"docs/02-SRS.md#NFR-01","description":{"status":"generated","description":"| NFR-01 | Exact IDR arithmetic and consistent totals | All deterministic fixtures pass with no floating-point rounding. |","source":"description"},"occurrences":null,"type":"Requirement","community":9,"community_name":"Atomic sales and retries"},"docs/02-SRS.md#NFR-02":{"id":"docs/02-SRS.md#NFR-02","description":{"status":"generated","description":"| NFR-02 | Tool response p95 below 1 second for local business queries; visible refresh p95 below 2 seconds after commit | 100 operations over 10,000 seeded sales in the chosen deployment; excludes speech recognition and synthesis. Record environment and cold starts. |","source":"description"},"occurrences":null,"type":"Requirement","community":7,"community_name":"Verification and release readiness"},"docs/02-SRS.md#NFR-03":{"id":"docs/02-SRS.md#NFR-03","description":{"status":"generated","description":"| NFR-03 | Voice turn comp